{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46874","headline":"荆门寄沈彬 · 齐己","name":"荆门寄沈彬","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"罢趋明圣嬾从知，鹤氅褵褷遂性披。\n道有静君堪托迹，诗无贤子拟传谁。\n松声白日边行止，日影红霞里梦思。\n珍重两篇千里达，去年江上雪飞时。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46874.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46874","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}